    {
      "catalog_id": "T-70a9e6a7a83f64-01",
      "title": "Clear water by a leaking dishwasher on the kitchen floor is invisible from the doorway: crouch and look closely along the floor, inspect it and report it with its source",
      "perception": "realistic",
