      "risk_level": 1,
      "fidelity": "G",
      "target_fidelity": "S",
      "notes": "Perception is the skill: clear water on a hard floor is hidden (visible_veto) until the robot is within ~1.25 m (x1.5 crouched) in light, or looks closely along the floor while crouched; a spotted puddle reads as a 'puddle of liquid' (look-alike group floor_liquid) until inspected (clear liquid, no smell, seeping from under the source, named by handle). Truth: _hazard kind water_on_floor (+aliases) and _source (id/label/category)."
    },
